"""Additive expansion seed: insert 218 researched interview questions into the questions table.

Question data is inlined (self-contained, no runtime vault dependency).

Fields map to the questions table schema:
  questions(id, company, role, topic, difficulty, question, source)
  topic  = the JSON "topic" field (e.g. "MCP internals", "mechanistic-interpretability-superposition")
  role   = the JSON "role" field (ai-eng | ml | ds | fde | research | quant)
  pillar is embedded by tagging topic as "<original-topic> | pillar:<PillarName>" so that
         get_questions(topic="CS Fundamentals") or get_questions(topic="Research & Frontier")
         will match these rows via the LIKE %...% filter.

DEDUP: INSERT OR IGNORE on the unique question text — re-runs are completely safe.
ADDITIVE: no updates, no deletes.

Run:
  uv run python scripts/seed_questions_expansion.py           (dry run — counts only)
  uv run python scripts/seed_questions_expansion.py --apply   (writes to live DB)
"""

